# Witness: exclusions written as list items inside the exclusion section

The VM-0 bundle writes some exclusions as list items rather than as table rows. Both forms
define, and only inside section 9. This fragment cites EX-61, EX-62 and EX-63; the first two
are defined below and EX-63 is defined nowhere, so EX-63 is the only violation.

## 9. Exclusions

- **EX-61** - Defined as a list item inside the exclusion section.

| ID | Status | Exclusion |
|---|---|---|
| EX-62 | Open | Defined as a table row inside the exclusion section. |
